pAndTrainingDoor?version=2&resource=https://help.salesforce.com/articleView?id=sf.console_lex_update_service_setup_assistant.htm&language=en_US\" target=\"_blank\">See What's New<\/a>","completionReminderTitle":"Finish setting up Service Cloud","updateReminderTitle":"Service updates are available","completionReminderActionLabel":"Go to Setup Assistant","completionReminderSummary":"Ready to get started with Service Cloud? Let the Service Setup Assistant help you create your Service app, key tools for agents, and more.","dismissLabel":"Not Now","completionReminderSummary30Days":"Ready to get started with Service Cloud? Let the Service Setup Assistant help you create your Service app, key tools for agents, and more. We\u2019ll stop reminding you after this."},"PardotSetupAssistant":{"PromptHeader":"Implement Pardot features faster","PromptText":"Use the new Pardot Setup Assistant to implement features and customize your business unit."},"DataStreamRecordHome":{"RefreshFilesGuidanceSummary":"You can now run an immediate file refresh for only new files or all the files that satisfy the data stream file name specification.","RefreshFilesGuidanceTitle":"Targeted Refresh Available","RefreshFilesGuidanceSummaryForSFMCStreams":"You can now run an on demand full or incremental data refresh for Marketing Cloud data streams."},"LightningConsoleDialogs":{"AppNavPopoverText":"Keep multiple list views handy by opening nav items in a workspace tab. Hold {0} and click on any nav item to open it in its own tab. When the nav item is open in a new tab, try \"{1}\" or \"{2}\" from the tab dropdown menu to personalize your workflow.","AppNavPopoverTitle":"Juggle list views like a pro."},"SidePanel":{"PinGuidanceCenterPromptTitle":"Pin and unpin this panel","DismissButton":"Dismiss","PinGuidanceCenterPromptBody":"When this panel is pinned, you can view the panel and the page side-by-side without overlap. When this panel is unpinned, the panel overlaps the page. Your selection persists when you go to a new page."},"ProgressiveOnboarding":{"ConvertLeadStepTitle":"Looking good?","ConvertLeadStepSummary":"<p>Review and click <strong>Convert<\/strong> to see Salesforce magic.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>We'll turn this lead into three new records:<\/p><p>- Account<\/p><p>- Contact<\/p><p>- Opportunity<\/p>","SalesblazerStepSummary":"Get the latest sales trends and insights from top sellers in the Salesblazer community.","LeadStatusStepSummary":"<p>Once you know your lead is interested, it\u2019s time to convert them into records you can view across Salesforce. <\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Click <strong>Converted<\/strong> then <strong>Select Converted Status <\/strong>.<\/p>","SalesblazerStepTitle":"Stay in the know","ConvertLeadConfirmationSummary":"Click the opportunity name to move this deal forward.","LeadStatusStepTitle":"Leads are deals-in-the-making","ConvertLeadConfirmationTitle":"Woo-hoo!"},"HelpMenu":{"HelpTriggerPopover":"The Help Menu is your one-stop shop for training, tips, and more."},"CICallCoachingOnboarding":{"OnboardingCallCoachingPanelSummary":"Your Salesforce admin has enabled Conversation Insights for you. See insights and trends surfaced within your conversations with customers.","OnboardingCallCoachingPanelFooterActionLabel":"Go to Conversation Insights","OnboardingPanelDismissLabel":"Remind Me Later","OnboardingCallCoachingPanelTitle":"Start Using Einstein Conversation Insights!"},"udd_DeleteEvent":{"Entities":"Recycle Bin"},"QuickTextPrompts":{"QuickTextEmailIntroPopoverTitle":"Try out Quick Text","QuickTextModalIntroPopoverBody":"Pick the response that makes the most sense and click Send. Your team will be sending messages in record time!","QuickTextButtonPopoverTitle":"Quickly respond to customers","QuickTextEmailIntroPopoverBody":"Quick Text lets your team access common responses in seconds. Click into the email composer to try it out.","QuickTextButtonPopoverBody":"Quick Texts help you get work done faster. Click the chat bubble icon in the email toolbar to see them.","QuickTextModalIntroPopoverTitle":"Choose a response, and that\u2019s it!"},"UmaSetupUncheckedCheckboxWalkthrough":{"Label":"You monitor the progress of this step manually. Mark it complete after you finish the setup step."},"RecycleBinHelp":{"ActionButton":"Show Me","DismissButton":"Tell Me More","Title":"Restore records from the Recycle Bin","Summary":"Find the Recycle Bin in the Lightning Experience App Launcher or add it to your navigation bar. Admins can restore and permanently delete other users\u2019 records."},"Guardrails":{"GuardrailsHeavyPagesDockHeader":"Optimize Lightning page performance","GuardrailsHeavyPagesDockTitle":"New in Spring \u201922 for Admins Only","GuardrailsImgAltText":"The Performance section of the Page tab in the Lightning Usage App.","GuardrailsHeavyPagesContent":"We found Lightning pages that can run more efficiently. View page performance and take action in the Lightning Usage App.","TakeMeThere":"Take Me There","TellMeMore":"Tell Me More"},"LightningAlert":{"defaultLabel":"Alert"},"DataManagerOnboarding":{"AccessStagedDataBody":"A faster alternative to datasets for multiple recipe data strategies. An initial recipe produces staged data, which is used as input for subsequent recipes. This reduces processing time. To learn more, see Salesforce Help on staged datasets and their limitations.","AccessRecipesBody":"View and create recipes. Your dataflows are still available from the Manage Dataflows link below.","AccessStagedDataHeader":"Staged Dataset","AccessDataflowsBody":"Manage your dataflows with this link as you convert them to recipes.","AccessRecipesHeader":"Access your recipes","AccessDataflowsHeader":"Access your dataflows"},"ping_MLTargetedPrompt":{"ButtonLabel":"Expand Your Skill Set","Body":"There's new content for you in the Guidance Center. Take a look and level up."},"Onboarding":{"DockedComposerTitle":"See How It Works","DockedComposerBody":"We're setting up your Salesforce subscription. It will be ready soon! In the meantime, watch this video to see how to use Your Account to purchase and renew licenses, view and download invoices, and communicate with your account contact from within Salesforce.","DockedComposerHeaderTitle":"Welcome to Your Account"},"ConnectorsFrameworkSetup":{"BetaConnectorsPopoverHeader":"Add New Connectors (Beta)","BetaConnectorsPopoverButton":"View Connectors","BetaConnectorsPopoverBody":"Enable new beta connectors to access your data wherever it resides."},"UnifiedAnalytics_Onboarding":{"SamplePromptBody":"$Label.UnifiedAnalytics_Onboarding.SamplePromptBody does not exist.","SamplePromptTitle":"$Label.UnifiedAnalytics_Onboarding.SamplePromptTitle does not exist.","SamplePromptButton":"$Label.UnifiedAnalytics_Onboarding.SamplePromptButton does not exist."},"DigitalWallet_Seller":{"WelcomeMatTitle":"Welcome to Digital Wallet!","WelcomeMatBody":"Digital Wallet gives your customers the data and tools they need to monitor their consumption-based entitlements. To give you transparency and insights about their consumption, Salesforce strives to update data multiple times a day, though it can take longer in some situations."},"ping_Common":{"TitleHiUsername":"$Label.ping_Common.TitleHiUsername does not exist.","Dismiss":"Dismiss","GotIt":"Got It","CheckItOut":"Check It Out","TitleHiUserName":"Hi, {0}!"},"EinsteinSearchFeaturesEnabledAdminPopover":{"featuresEnabledAdminPopoverLearnMore":"Learn More"},"EasyNewQuotePrompt":{"summary":"The negotiation stage is a great time to send a quote. Click <b>New Quote<\/b> to get started.","title":"Send this customer a quote","dismissLabel":"Skip"},"EnablementCoachingOption":{"GuidanceCenterAIFeedbackPromptButton":"Got It","ProgramBuilderAIFeedbackPromptButton":"Got It","ProgramBuilderAIFeedbackPromptHeader":"Give feedback at scale with AI","GuidanceCenterAIFeedbackPromptBody":"You\u2019re about to receive personal, and actionable AI-generated feedback to help you enhance your skills and further excel in your role.<br/>Generative AI can produce inaccurate or harmful responses. Review output for accuracy and safety.","GuidanceCenterAIFeedbackPromptHeader":"Experience AI-powered feedback","ProgramBuilderAIFeedbackPromptBody":"Help users excel with real-time, personalized, and actionable feedback.<br/>Generative AI can produce inaccurate or harmful responses. You assume responsibility for how Einstein recommendations are applied to your organization.<a href=\"/HelpAndTrainingDoor?version=2&resource=https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?language=en_US&id=sf.generative_ai_trust_overview.htm&type=5\" target=\"_blank\"> <u>Learn more<\/u><\/a>"},"Territory2Maps":{"Visualize":"Visualize territory boundaries to identify gaps in coverage.","BodyHeader":"Build and realign territories using Territory Planning, which helps you:","Integrate":"Integrate with and make the most of Enterprise Territory Management.","ButtonLabel":"Tell Me More","Header":"Plan Territories with Salesforce Maps","Title":"Set Up Enterprise Territory Management More Easily","Morale":"Improve employee morale with equitable and efficient assignments."},"LightningConsoleTabs":{"customizeTab":"Customize Tab","pinTab":"Pin Tab"},"ping_FlowsForServicesTargetedGCIconPrompt":{"ButtonLabel":"Learn About Flows","Title":"Rethink Your Case Handling Strategy","Body":"\n        Use Salesforce Flow for Service to automate your agents\u2019 routine tasks so they can resolve cases faster. Eliminate guesswork by creating a guided checklist or set of actions for agents to follow.\n        <br/>\n        <br/>\n        Learn how to set up this powerful productivity tool today.\n        "},"TodoListDiscoveryFeaturePrompt":{"bodyText":"Organize what needs to be done using Labels, filters, and groups.","dismissButton":"Got It","title":"Stay focused with the To Do List"},"OnboardingRuntime":{"WarningToastForSplitView":"To ensure the walkthrough displays properly, close split view before continuing"},"OpportunityScoringOnboa