utomate case management tasks, such as generating customer emails and updating a case status. Take this Quick Look to learn how macros help boost your productivity."},"EinsteinAssistantPopover":{"EinsteinAssistantCollapsedPopoverTitle":"Einstein","EinsteinAssistantHeaderPopoverTitle":"Start using Einstein Generative AI","EinsteinAssistantCollapsedPopoverText":"Speed through your daily workflow with Einstein.","EinsteinAssistantHeaderPopoverText":"Get help filling out the fields on this record.","EinsteinAssistantPopoverfooterAction":"Learn More"},"ECIUserWalkthrough":{"ECIWalkthroughPlayerBody":"Use the player controls to change talk speed or jump between mentions with the arrows. The related text is automatically displayed in the Transcript tab.","ECIWalkthroughExpertLink":"Go to dashboard","ECIWalkthroughInsightHeader":"Welcome! Jump to key moments","ECIWalkthroughPlayerHeader":"Play, pause, and see the transcript","ECIWalkthroughActionItemsHeader":"Review action items","ECIWalkthroughExpertHeader":"You\u2019re now an ECI expert!","ECIWalkthroughActionItemsBody":"Use the Action Items tab to quickly address follow-up tasks based on key insights mentioned in your conversation.","ECIWalkthroughCommentHeader":"Comment on call segments","ECIWalkthroughDismissLabel":"Skip","ECIWalkthroughCommentBody":"Click the timeline to add a comment to a specific timestamp, and see comments in the Chatter feed. @Mention your manager or team to keep them aligned on customer feedback.","ECIWalkthroughExpertBody":"Go forth and use your knowledge to get more value out of your conversations. To see all your calls, check out the Conversation Insights dashboard.","ECIWalkthroughInsightBody":"Call insights appear here. Click one to listen to parts of a conversation that are important to you."},"AdoptionComposer":{"densityContentHeader":"See more without scrolling","appNavDockedContentHeader":"Personalize your navigation","densityDockedTitle":"Try Out the Compact Setting","appNavDockedTitle"