ave these required permissions:<ul><li>Salesforce admin profile<\/li><li>Marketing Cloud admin permission set<\/li><li>Data Cloud admin permission set<\/li><\/ul>","ChannelsTileTooltipDescription":"After you enable Marketing Cloud in Basic Settings, complete the remaining tasks in both Channels and Reporting and Optimization.","MceRequiredStepsTileTooltipTitle":"Set up new channels","MceTransformationTileHeader":"Start here","AdditionalStepsTileTooltipTitle":"Explore additional features","MceRequiredStepsTileTooltipDescription":"To add marketing channels, complete the required setup for each.","MceTransformationTileDescription":"Connect your Marketing Cloud Engagement data. You can also set up Marketing Performance to get the latest reporting features right away.","TooltipNextButton":"Next","ChannelsTileTooltipTitle":"Complete Setup","BasicSettingsTileTooltipTitleV2":"Start here","TooltipNextButtonV2":"Next","BusinessUnitTileTooltipTitle":"Review your business units","BasicSettingsTileTooltipDescription":"To access the full setup experience, go to Basic Settings and confirm that you completed the prerequisites to enable Marketing Cloud.","RequiredStepsTileTooltipDescription":"Configure the most important settings for your marketing channels and reporting.","RequiredStepsTileTooltipTitle":"Complete the required setup","BasicSettingsTileTooltipTitle":"Start Here","ViewImplementationTileTooltipDescription":"Review this setup tour or find step-by-step instructions in our implementation guide.","TooltipGotItButton":"Got It","TooltipDismissButtonV2":"Dismiss","ViewImplementationTileTooltipTitle":"Need help?","MceTransformationOnlyTileDescription":"First, connect your Marketing Cloud Engagement data. You can also set up Marketing Performance to get the latest reporting features right away.","AdditionalStepsTileTooltipDescription":"Discover ways to learn more about your audience, improve engagement, and customize your marketing experience.","BusinessUnitTileTooltipDescription":"Configure certain settings for each business unit individually. Here, you can access setup for a specific business unit or go to your business units home page.","TooltipCloseButtonV2":"Got it","BasicSettingsTileTooltipTitleExtended":"Configure basic settings","TooltipCloseButton":"Close"},"MobileHomeFeatureEnablementPrompt":{"Header":"Enable the new home page for the Salesforce mobile app","ActionLabel":"Tell Me More","Title":"Mobile Home Is Now GA","Summary":"In the Winter \u201922 release, the Salesforce mobile app includes a new ready-to-use navigation tab called Mobile Home. Add it to your Lightning apps like any other tab with no additional configuration needed!"},"LightningInteractiveDialogBase":{"cancel":"Cancel","ok":"OK"},"CopilotPrompt":{"CopilotPromptTitle":"Say hello to Agentforce","CopilotPromptFooterActionLabel":"Get Started","CopilotPromptSummary":"Chat with an AI agent to draft emails, create summaries, and more."},"ping_FlowsForServicesDockedReengagementPrompt":{"ButtonLabel":"Learn More","Header":"Automation for Agents","Title":"Improve customer satisfaction","Body":"Use Salesforce Flow for Service to drive consistent handling across case processes with powerful automation."},"PrioritizationPrompt":{"ActionLabel":"Start Prioritizing","Title":"Influence Our Product Roadmap","Summary":"Calling all admins! IdeaExchange Prioritization is now open. In just a few minutes, you can review top ideas and prioritize them for consideration in a future release.","DismissLabel":"Dismiss","Badge":"Admin Notice"},"CdpCommon":{"RefreshNow":"Refresh Now","Close":"Close"},"LearningSidebarIntro":{"EndUserWalkthroughTitle":"Find help along the way","AdminWalkthroughStep1Content":"As an admin, you can find curated guidance sets for customizing Salesforce. Users see Trailhead modules and custom help, along with help for the page they\u2019re currently on.","EndUserWalkthroughContent":"Find helpful information about using Salesforce. Your company sometimes adds custom learning content as well.","AdminWalkthroughStep1Title":"Meet the new Guidance Center","AdminWalkthroughStep2Content":"Your users can access existing Learning Paths assignments and Learning Home. Visit Learning Home to create new assignments for your users.","AdminWalkthroughStep2Button":"Go to Learning Home","AdminWalkthroughStep2Title":"Come back anytime"},"ping_ListViewsQuickLookPrompt":{"ButtonLabel":"Learn About List Views","Body":"List Views help organize your data. Create custom list views to filter and see what's important to you."},"GuidanceCenterPopover":{"ReturnToGuidanceCenterText":"Click the icon to get help whenever you need it.","ReturnToGuidanceCenterHeader":"Come back anytime","GetStartedPopoverText":"$Label.GuidanceCenterPopover.GetStartedPopoverText does not exist.","GetStartedPopoverHeader":"$Label.GuidanceCenterPopover.GetStartedPopoverHeader does not exist."},"PrebuiltServiceSetupAssistantDataPrompt":{"PrebuiltEmailTemplateIntroTitle":"Check out your automatic case emails","PrebuiltEmailTemplatesSupportSettingsDesc":"The settings on this page control when the case contact receives email notifications and which templates are used. Optionally, add your own email templates and settings to address any scenarios we haven\u2019t covered.","PrebuiltHelpCenterBuilderTitle":"Add articles and publish your help center","PrebuiltEmailTemplatesSupportSettingsTitle":"Email customers when it matters","PrebuiltSSADismissButton":"Dismiss","PrebuiltEmailTemplatesNodeDesc":"Your sample templates await you in the Public Email Templates folder. Edit each template so it reflects your company\u2019s brand and policies. Then, review your auto-send settings.","PrebuiltEmailTemplatesNodeTitle":"Add your personal touch","PrebuiltEmailTemplateIntroDesc":"Customers are emailed when their case is created, updated, assigned, or closed. Neat, huh? Let\u2019s head to your settings to personalize your email templates or create new ones.","PrebuiltSurveysIntroNext":"View Surveys","PrebuiltSSANextButton":"Next","PrebuiltSurveysIntroTitle":"How happy are your customers?","PrebuiltHelpCenterIntroDesc":"We\u2019ve created a simple help center for you where customers can find answers without contacting support. Let\u2019s head to your settings to add knowledge articles, preview the experience, and publish your help center.","PrebuiltSurveysIntroDesc":"Use our pre-built surveys to measure your company\u2019s Net Promoter Score (NPS) and Customer Satisfaction (CSAT). <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/HelpAndTrainingDoor?version=2&resource=https://help.salesforce.com/articleView?id=sf.cases_set_up_lex_surveys.htm\">Learn More in Salesforce Help<\/a>","PrebuiltSSAFinishButton":"Finish","PrebuiltHelpCenterBuilderDesc":"To open your help center settings, click Builder next to Default Help Center. Add knowledge articles and publish your help center to make it public. After it\u2019s published, customers can browse articles or submit a simple form to create a case. Nice!","PrebuiltHelpCenterIntroTitle":"Help your customers help themselves"},"PipelineInspectorDockedPrompt":{"ActivityInsightsBody":"Dig in with data and close more deals. Get metrics such as number of days to close, days in stage, and details about recent meetings, calls, and emails.","Header":"Work smarter with Pipeline Inspection","PriorityRecordBody":"Mark opportunities as important to see them all in one list view. You can also see important opportunities in your filtered views.","ActivityInsightsTitle":"View deal metrics and activity details","PriorityRecordTitle":"Track important opportunities","MainBanner":"Gain More Insight Into Pipeline Health"},"SpotlightRecipe":{"SyncContactsStepSummary":"To experience the deal-winning, case-closing magic of Salesforce, import your contacts or sync them from your contact management apps.","DescribeLeadsListEmailStepSummary":"Get the conversation started and make it count by emailing all your leads at once.","DescribeLeadsListEmailStepTitle":"Relationships win deals","SyncContactsStepTitle":"Gather your contacts in one place"},"OTVTalkNotification":{"header":"New: Dialer"},"FormulaEinsteinAssistantPopover":{"Header":"Einstein Formulas","LearnMore":"Learn More","BodyText":"Get a deeper understanding of your formulas with Einstein."},"LightningIsotope":{"AdminDockedPromptLink":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AdminDockedPromptLink does not exist.","AdminDockedPromptSummary":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AdminDockedPromptSummary does not exist.","ChatGlobalHeaderPopoverHeader":"$Label.LightningIsotope.ChatGlobalHeaderPopoverHeader does not exist.","AdminDockedPromptButton":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AdminDockedPromptButton does not exist.","RecordHomePopoverText":"$Label.LightningIsotope.RecordHomePopoverText does not exist.","RecordHomePopoverHeader":"$Label.LightningIsotope.RecordHomePopoverHeader does not exist.","AdminDockedPromptHeader":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AdminDockedPromptHeader does not exist.","AdminDockedPromptTitle":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AdminDockedPromptTitle does not exist.","ChatGlobalHeaderPopoverText":"$Label.LightningIsotope.ChatGlobalHeaderPopoverText does not exist.","AlertGlobalHeaderPopoverButton":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AlertGlobalHeaderPopoverButton does not exist.","AlertGlobalHeaderPopoverHeader":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AlertGlobalHeaderPopoverHeader does not exist.","AlertGlobalHeaderPopoverText":"$Label.LightningIsotope.AlertGlobalHeaderPopoverText does not exist."},"SetupDiscovery_FeatureConfigurationStep":{"Intro_SystemValidatedStep":"We validate the progress of this step for you. When you meet the minimum requirement, we mark it complete.","Intro_ManualValidatedStep":"You monitor the progress of this step manually. Mark it complete after you finish the setup step."},"EasyHomeWalkthrough":{"StepFooterTitle":"Skip","ToolbarStepSummary":"Productivity tools like To Dos appear in the utility bar based on where you\u2019re working.","HelpIconStepTitle":"Discover helpful resources","NavigationStepSummary":"Quickly access a powerful suite of features. Customize your app order with drag and drop.","NavigationStepTitle":"Explore your apps","ToolbarStepTitle":"Work smarter","HelpIconStepSummary":"Learn Salesforce and get up to speed quickly. Tip: explore each icon to see what\u2019s possible!"},"PipelineInspectorCloseDateAIPrompt":{"Description":"See insights about your deal to help you assess progress, and actions to take to win the deal.","Title":"Get more insight into your deal health"},"PeopleScoringSetupPage":{"Step1Title":"Move people through your pipeline with scoring","NextButton":"Next","FinishButton":"Finish","DismissButton":"Dismiss","Step2Title":"Decide which records to score","Step3Description":"Review the default scoring rules on this page. You can edit or delete the default rules, and create new rules as needed.","Step4Description":"When you\u2019re ready to begin scoring, publish your rules. After you publish rules, you can edit and republish them. You can\u2019t unpublish rules or save rules as drafts.","Step3Title":"Customize scoring rules","Step2Description":"Scores are applied to unified individual profiles. A unified individual is a consolidated view of a lead or contact based on identity resolution rules that you set.","Step1Description":"Get a feel for who is most likely to purchase by looking at their scores. Decide how to weigh engagement and fit in the overall score.","Step4Title":"Publish scoring rules"},"DigitalWalletWelcomeMat":{"Title":"Welcome to {0}!","Body":"{0} gives you the data and tools you need to monitor your consumption-based entitlements. To give you transparency and insights about your consumption, Salesforce strives to update data multiple times a day, though it can take longer in some situations."}}}],false,false);